"# Sharing API\n\n- **Base URL:** `https://sharing-api.sls.epilot.io`\n- **Full API Docs:** [https://docs.epilot.io/api/sharing](https://docs.epilot.io/api/sharing)\n\n## Usage\n\n```ts\nimport { epilot } from '@epilot/sdk'\n\nepilot.authorize(() => '<token>')\nconst { data } = await epilot.sharing.getSharingConfiguration(...)\n```\n\n### Tree-shakeable import\n\n```ts\nimport { getClient, authorize } from '@epilot/sdk/sharing'\n\nconst sharingClient = getClient()\nauthorize(sharingClient, () => '<token>')\nconst { data } = await sharingClient.getSharingConfiguration(...)\n```\n\n## Operations\n\n**Sharing Configuration**\n- [`getSharingConfiguration`](#getsharingconfiguration)\n- [`updateSharingConfiguration`](#updatesharingconfiguration)\n- [`deleteSharingConfiguration`](#deletesharingconfiguration)\n- [`assignRoleToConfiguration`](#assignroletoconfiguration)\n- [`getSharingConfigurations`](#getsharingconfigurations)\n- [`listSharingConfigurations`](#listsharingconfigurations)\n- [`searchPartnerSharingConfigurations`](#searchpartnersharingconfigurations)\n- [`getConfigurationsByTemplateRole`](#getconfigurationsbytemplaterole)\n\n**Entity Sharing**\n- [`shareEntityWithPartners`](#shareentitywithpartners)\n- [`shareChildEntityWithPartners`](#sharechildentitywithpartners)\n- [`getEntitySharingEvents`](#getentitysharingevents)\n\n**Entity Offering**\n- [`offerEntityToPartners`](#offerentitytopartners)\n- [`getOfferStatus`](#getofferstatus)\n- [`acceptOffer`](#acceptoffer)\n\n**Sharing Rules**\n- [`listSharingRules`](#listsharingrules)\n- [`createSharingRule`](#createsharingrule)\n- [`getSharingRule`](#getsharingrule)\n- [`updateSharingRule`](#updatesharingrule)\n- [`deleteSharingRule`](#deletesharingrule)\n\n**Schemas**\n- [`PartnerSharingConfig`](#partnersharingconfig)\n- [`EntitySummary`](#entitysummary)\n- [`PartnerStatus`](#partnerstatus)\n- [`EntityResource`](#entityresource)\n- [`OfferEntityResource`](#offerentityresource)\n- [`TemplateRoleGrant`](#templaterolegrant)\n- [`OfferStatus`](#offerstatus)\n- [`PartialEntity`](#partialentity)\n- [`OfferStatusEnum`](#offerstatusenum)\n- [`EntityResourceInput`](#entityresourceinput)\n- [`OfferEntityResourceInput`](#offerentityresourceinput)\n- [`UpdateSharingConfigurationPayload`](#updatesharingconfigurationpayload)\n- [`AssignRolePayload`](#assignrolepayload)\n- [`SearchSharingConfigurationsPayload`](#searchsharingconfigurationspayload)\n- [`SearchEntityResourceInput`](#searchentityresourceinput)\n- [`SharingEntityPayload`](#sharingentitypayload)\n- [`PartnerEntitiesInput`](#partnerentitiesinput)\n- [`ShareChildEntityPayload`](#sharechildentitypayload)\n- [`PartnerEntityInput`](#partnerentityinput)\n- [`OfferEntityPayload`](#offerentitypayload)\n- [`PartnerOfferedEntitiesInput`](#partnerofferedentitiesinput)\n- [`AcceptOfferPayload`](#acceptofferpayload)\n- [`SharingRuleInput`](#sharingruleinput)\n- [`SharingRuleUpdate`](#sharingruleupdate)\n- [`SharingRule`](#sharingrule)\n- [`SharingRuleConditions`](#sharingruleconditions)\n- [`Statement`](#statement)\n- [`SharingRuleAiConfig`](#sharingruleaiconfig)\n- [`EntitySharingEventsResponse`](#entitysharingeventsresponse)\n- [`EntitySharingEvent`](#entitysharingevent)\n- [`EntitySharingEventUser`](#entitysharingeventuser)\n- [`EntitySharingEventEntity`](#entitysharingevententity)\n\n### `getSharingConfiguration`\n\nReturns the sharing configuration for a specific partner organization with its assigned users and an `entity_summary` of the shared and offered records. `entities` and `offered_entities` are not retur\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/configurations/{partner_org_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getSharingConfiguration({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"users\": [\"string\"],\n  \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_accepted\": true,\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offered_entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n      \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"template_role_grants\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"string\",\n      \"resource\": \"string\",\n      \"effect\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"user_limit\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"string\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_summary\": {\n    \"shared_total\": 0,\n    \"offered_total\": 0,\n    \"shared_by_schema\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"count\": 0,\n        \"root_count\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `updateSharingConfiguration`\n\nUpdates the sharing configuration for a partner, such as the user limit. Also patches the internal role if the user limit changes.\n\n`PATCH /v1/sharing/configurations/{partner_org_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.updateSharingConfiguration(\n  {\n    partner_org_id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    user_limit: 0\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"users\": [\"string\"],\n  \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_accepted\": true,\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offered_entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n      \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"template_role_grants\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"string\",\n      \"resource\": \"string\",\n      \"effect\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"user_limit\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"string\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_summary\": {\n    \"shared_total\": 0,\n    \"offered_total\": 0,\n    \"shared_by_schema\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"count\": 0,\n        \"root_count\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `deleteSharingConfiguration`\n\nDeletes the sharing configuration for a partner, removing all shared and offered entity access.\n\n`DELETE /v1/sharing/configurations/{partner_org_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.deleteSharingConfiguration({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"users\": [\"string\"],\n  \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_accepted\": true,\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offered_entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n      \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"template_role_grants\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"string\",\n      \"resource\": \"string\",\n      \"effect\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"user_limit\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"string\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_summary\": {\n    \"shared_total\": 0,\n    \"offered_total\": 0,\n    \"shared_by_schema\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"count\": 0,\n        \"root_count\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `assignRoleToConfiguration`\n\nAssigns a template role to a partner sharing configuration. The role grants are copied into the configuration for entity access control.\n\n`PUT /v1/sharing/configurations/{partner_org_id}/role`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.assignRoleToConfiguration(\n  {\n    partner_org_id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    template_role_id: 'string'\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"users\": [\"string\"],\n  \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_accepted\": true,\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offered_entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n      \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"template_role_grants\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"string\",\n      \"resource\": \"string\",\n      \"effect\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"user_limit\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"string\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_summary\": {\n    \"shared_total\": 0,\n    \"offered_total\": 0,\n    \"shared_by_schema\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"count\": 0,\n        \"root_count\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `getSharingConfigurations`\n\nReturns sharing configurations for multiple partner organizations in a single batch request.\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/configurations`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getSharingConfigurations({\n  partner_org_ids: ['...'],\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `listSharingConfigurations`\n\nLists all sharing configurations of the organization, without their entities. Paginated with an opaque cursor; keep paging while `next_cursor` is returned. Only available to the organization's own use\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/configurations:list`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.listSharingConfigurations({\n  size: 1,\n  cursor: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n      \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n      \"users\": [\"string\"],\n      \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n      \"entities\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"offer_accepted\": true,\n          \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n          \"created_at\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"offered_entities\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n          \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n          \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n          \"created_at\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n      \"template_role_grants\": [\n        {\n          \"action\": \"string\",\n          \"resource\": \"string\",\n          \"effect\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n      \"user_limit\": 0,\n      \"created_at\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_summary\": {\n        \"shared_total\": 0,\n        \"offered_total\": 0,\n        \"shared_by_schema\": [\n          {\n            \"schema\": \"string\",\n            \"count\": 0,\n            \"root_count\": 0\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"has_share_role\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_cursor\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `searchPartnerSharingConfigurations`\n\nSearches for partner sharing configurations that have access to the given entities. Returns configurations with their shared and offered entity lists.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/configurations:search`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.searchPartnerSharingConfigurations(\n  null,\n  {\n    entities: [\n      {\n        schema: 'string',\n        entity_id: 'string',\n        parent_entity_id: 'string',\n        offer_accepted: true\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `getConfigurationsByTemplateRole`\n\nReturns all partner sharing configurations that reference the given template role ID. Useful for checking role usage before deletion.\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/configurations/by-role/{template_role_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getConfigurationsByTemplateRole({\n  template_role_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `shareEntityWithPartners`\n\nShares or unshares top-level entities with one or more partner organizations. Publishes sharing events for downstream processing.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/entities:share`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.shareEntityWithPartners(\n  null,\n  {\n    share: [\n      {\n        partner_org_id: 'string',\n        entities: [\n          {\n            schema: 'string',\n            entity_id: 'string',\n            parent_entity_id: 'string',\n            offer_accepted: true\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    unshare: [\n      {\n        partner_org_id: 'string',\n        entities: [\n          {\n            schema: 'string',\n            entity_id: 'string',\n            parent_entity_id: 'string',\n            offer_accepted: true\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `shareChildEntityWithPartners`\n\nShares or unshares child entities (entities that belong to an already-shared parent) with partner organizations.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/entities:share-child`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.shareChildEntityWithPartners(\n  null,\n  {\n    share: [\n      {\n        entity: {\n          schema: 'string',\n          entity_id: 'string',\n          parent_entity_id: 'string',\n          offer_accepted: true\n        },\n        partner_org_id: 'string'\n      }\n    ],\n    unshare: [\n      {\n        entity: {\n          schema: 'string',\n          entity_id: 'string',\n          parent_entity_id: 'string',\n          offer_accepted: true\n        },\n        partner_org_id: 'string'\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `offerEntityToPartners`\n\nOffers or unoffers entities to partner organizations using a First Come First Served model. Only one partner can accept each offered entity.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/entities:offer`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.offerEntityToPartners(\n  null,\n  {\n    offer: [\n      {\n        partner_org_id: 'string',\n        offered_entities: [\n          {\n            schema: 'string',\n            entity_id: 'string',\n            parent_entity_id: 'string'\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    unoffer: [\n      {\n        partner_org_id: 'string',\n        offered_entities: [\n          {\n            schema: 'string',\n            entity_id: 'string',\n            parent_entity_id: 'string'\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n    \"users\": [\"string\"],\n    \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_accepted\": true,\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"offered_entities\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n        \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n        \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n        \"created_at\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"template_role_grants\": [\n      {\n        \"action\": \"string\",\n        \"resource\": \"string\",\n        \"effect\": \"string\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n    \"user_limit\": 0,\n    \"created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n    \"entity_summary\": {\n      \"shared_total\": 0,\n      \"offered_total\": 0,\n      \"shared_by_schema\": [\n        {\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"count\": 0,\n          \"root_count\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `getEntitySharingEvents`\n\nReturns the sharing history of an entity, reconstructed from the audit log. `total` counts matching audit log entries, not returned events - a single log entry can describe both a share and an unshare\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/entities/{entity_id}/events`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getEntitySharingEvents({\n  entity_id: 'example',\n  limit: 1,\n  page: 1,\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"string\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"status\": \"success\",\n      \"action\": \"shared\",\n      \"user\": {\n        \"user_id\": \"string\",\n        \"email\": \"string\",\n        \"display_name\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"partner_org_ids\": [\"string\"],\n      \"entities\": [\n        {\n          \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"schema\": \"string\",\n          \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n          \"title\": \"string\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 0\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `getOfferStatus`\n\nReturns the current status of an entity offer (pending, accepted, expired). This is a public endpoint used from partner-facing pages without authentication.\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/offers/status`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getOfferStatus({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n  sharing_org_id: 'example',\n  entity_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"entity\": {\n    \"_schema\": \"string\",\n    \"_id\": \"string\",\n    \"_title\": \"string\",\n    \"_created_at\": \"string\",\n    \"_updated_at\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n  \"status_changed_at\": \"string\",\n  \"offered_at\": \"string\",\n  \"accepted_by_org_id\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `acceptOffer`\n\nAccepts an entity offer on behalf of a partner organization. This is a public endpoint used from partner-facing pages without authentication. Only one partner can accept each offer.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/offers:accept`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.acceptOffer(\n  null,\n  {\n    partner_org_id: 'string',\n    sharing_org_id: 'string',\n    entity_id: 'string'\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"sharing_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"users\": [\"string\"],\n  \"partner_status\": \"REGISTERED\",\n  \"entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_accepted\": true,\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offered_entities\": [\n    {\n      \"schema\": \"string\",\n      \"entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"parent_entity_id\": \"string\",\n      \"offer_status\": \"EXPIRED\",\n      \"offered_by_user_id\": \"string\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n      \"created_at\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"template_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"template_role_grants\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"string\",\n      \"resource\": \"string\",\n      \"effect\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"generated_role_id\": \"string\",\n  \"user_limit\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"string\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"string\",\n  \"entity_summary\": {\n    \"shared_total\": 0,\n    \"offered_total\": 0,\n    \"shared_by_schema\": [\n      {\n        \"schema\": \"string\",\n        \"count\": 0,\n        \"root_count\": 0\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `listSharingRules`\n\nLists the auto-sharing rules the caller's organization configured for a partner.\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/rules/{partner_org_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.listSharingRules({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n  enabled: true,\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"string\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"trigger_schema\": \"opportunity\",\n      \"include_schemas\": [\"string\"],\n      \"evaluation_type\": \"deterministic\",\n      \"conditions\": {\n        \"logical_operator\": \"AND\",\n        \"statements\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"string\",\n            \"source\": {\n              \"attribute\": \"string\",\n              \"attribute_type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"operator\": \"equals\",\n            \"values\": [\"string\"]\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"ai_config\": {\n        \"confidence_threshold\": 0,\n        \"guidance\": \"string\"\n      },\n      \"rule_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n      \"vendor_org_id\": \"string\",\n      \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n      \"source\": \"AUTO_SHARING_RULE\",\n      \"created_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"created_by\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `createSharingRule`\n\nCreates an auto-sharing rule for a partner.\n\n`POST /v1/sharing/rules/{partner_org_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.createSharingRule(\n  {\n    partner_org_id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    name: 'string',\n    enabled: true,\n    trigger_schema: 'opportunity',\n    include_schemas: ['string'],\n    evaluation_type: 'deterministic',\n    conditions: {\n      logical_operator: 'AND',\n      statements: [\n        {\n          id: 'string',\n          source: {\n            attribute: 'string',\n            attribute_type: 'string'\n          },\n          operator: 'equals',\n          values: ['string']\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    ai_config: {\n      confidence_threshold: 0,\n      guidance: 'string'\n    }\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"string\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"trigger_schema\": \"opportunity\",\n  \"include_schemas\": [\"string\"],\n  \"evaluation_type\": \"deterministic\",\n  \"conditions\": {\n    \"logical_operator\": \"AND\",\n    \"statements\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": {\n          \"attribute\": \"string\",\n          \"attribute_type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"operator\": \"equals\",\n        \"values\": [\"string\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"ai_config\": {\n    \"confidence_threshold\": 0,\n    \"guidance\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"rule_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"vendor_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"source\": \"AUTO_SHARING_RULE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `getSharingRule`\n\nReturns a single auto-sharing rule.\n\n`GET /v1/sharing/rules/{partner_org_id}/{rule_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.getSharingRule({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n  rule_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"string\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"trigger_schema\": \"opportunity\",\n  \"include_schemas\": [\"string\"],\n  \"evaluation_type\": \"deterministic\",\n  \"conditions\": {\n    \"logical_operator\": \"AND\",\n    \"statements\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": {\n          \"attribute\": \"string\",\n          \"attribute_type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"operator\": \"equals\",\n        \"values\": [\"string\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"ai_config\": {\n    \"confidence_threshold\": 0,\n    \"guidance\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"rule_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"vendor_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"source\": \"AUTO_SHARING_RULE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `updateSharingRule`\n\nPartially updates an auto-sharing rule. The patch is merged into the stored rule, which is then validated as a whole. Use `{ \"enabled\": false }` to disable a rule.\n\n`PATCH /v1/sharing/rules/{partner_org_id}/{rule_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.updateSharingRule(\n  {\n    partner_org_id: 'example',\n    rule_id: 'example',\n  },\n  {\n    name: 'string',\n    enabled: true,\n    trigger_schema: 'string',\n    include_schemas: ['string'],\n    evaluation_type: 'deterministic',\n    conditions: {\n      logical_operator: 'AND',\n      statements: [\n        {\n          id: 'string',\n          source: {\n            attribute: 'string',\n            attribute_type: 'string'\n          },\n          operator: 'equals',\n          values: ['string']\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    ai_config: {\n      confidence_threshold: 0,\n      guidance: 'string'\n    }\n  },\n)\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>Response</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"string\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"trigger_schema\": \"opportunity\",\n  \"include_schemas\": [\"string\"],\n  \"evaluation_type\": \"deterministic\",\n  \"conditions\": {\n    \"logical_operator\": \"AND\",\n    \"statements\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": {\n          \"attribute\": \"string\",\n          \"attribute_type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"operator\": \"equals\",\n        \"values\": [\"string\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"ai_config\": {\n    \"confidence_threshold\": 0,\n    \"guidance\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"rule_id\": \"3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6\",\n  \"vendor_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"partner_org_id\": \"string\",\n  \"source\": \"AUTO_SHARING_RULE\",\n  \"created_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"created_by\": \"string\"\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### `deleteSharingRule`\n\nDeletes an auto-sharing rule.\n\n`DELETE /v1/sharing/rules/{partner_org_id}/{rule_id}`\n\n```ts\nconst { data } = await client.deleteSharingRule({\n  partner_org_id: 'example',\n  rule_id: 'example',\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Schemas\n\n### `PartnerSharingConfig`\n\n```ts\ntype PartnerSharingConfig = {\n  sharing_org_id: string\n  partner_org_id: string\n  users?: string[]\n  partner_status?: \"REGISTERED\" | \"UNREGISTERED\"\n  entities?: Array<{\n    schema: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    offer_accepted?: boolean\n    updated_at?: string\n    created_at?: string\n  }>\n  offered_entities?: Array<{\n    schema: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    offer_status: \"EXPIRED\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\" | \"PENDING\" | \"DECLINED\" | \"ACCEPTED\"\n    offered_by_user_id?: string\n    updated_at?: string\n    created_at?: string\n  }>\n  template_role_id?: string\n  template_role_grants?: Array<{\n    action: string\n    resource: string\n    effect?: string\n  }>\n  generated_role_id?: string\n  user_limit?: number\n  created_at?: string\n  updated_at?: string\n  entity_summary?: {\n    shared_total: number\n    offered_total: number\n    shared_by_schema: Array<{\n      schema: { ... }\n      count: { ... }\n      root_count: { ... }\n    }>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### `EntitySummary`\n\nCounts of the records shared/offered with the partner. Only returned by the single-partner read.\n\n```ts\ntype EntitySummary = {\n  shared_total: number\n  offered_total: number\n  shared_by_schema: Array<{\n    schema: string\n    count: number\n    root_count: number\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `PartnerStatus`\n\n```ts\ntype PartnerStatus = \"REGISTERED\" | \"UNREGISTERED\"\n```\n\n### `EntityResource`\n\n```ts\ntype EntityResource = {\n  schema: string\n  entity_id: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n  offer_accepted?: boolean\n  updated_at?: string\n  created_at?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `OfferEntityResource`\n\n```ts\ntype OfferEntityResource = {\n  schema: string\n  entity_id: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n  offer_status: \"EXPIRED\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\" | \"PENDING\" | \"DECLINED\" | \"ACCEPTED\"\n  offered_by_user_id?: string\n  updated_at?: string\n  created_at?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `TemplateRoleGrant`\n\n```ts\ntype TemplateRoleGrant = {\n  action: string\n  resource: string\n  effect?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `OfferStatus`\n\n```ts\ntype OfferStatus = {\n  entity: {\n    _schema: string\n    _id: string\n    _title: string\n    _created_at: string\n    _updated_at: string\n  }\n  offer_status: \"EXPIRED\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\" | \"PENDING\" | \"DECLINED\" | \"ACCEPTED\"\n  status_changed_at?: string\n  offered_at?: string\n  accepted_by_org_id?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `PartialEntity`\n\n```ts\ntype PartialEntity = {\n  _schema: string\n  _id: string\n  _title: string\n  _created_at: string\n  _updated_at: string\n}\n```\n\n### `OfferStatusEnum`\n\n```ts\ntype OfferStatusEnum = \"EXPIRED\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\" | \"PENDING\" | \"DECLINED\" | \"ACCEPTED\"\n```\n\n### `EntityResourceInput`\n\n```ts\ntype EntityResourceInput = {\n  schema: string\n  entity_id: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n  offer_accepted?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n### `OfferEntityResourceInput`\n\n```ts\ntype OfferEntityResourceInput = {\n  schema: string\n  entity_id: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `UpdateSharingConfigurationPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype UpdateSharingConfigurationPayload = {\n  user_limit?: number\n}\n```\n\n### `AssignRolePayload`\n\n```ts\ntype AssignRolePayload = {\n  template_role_id: string\n}\n```\n\n### `SearchSharingConfigurationsPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype SearchSharingConfigurationsPayload = {\n  entities: Array<{\n    schema?: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    offer_accepted?: boolean\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `SearchEntityResourceInput`\n\n```ts\ntype SearchEntityResourceInput = {\n  schema?: string\n  entity_id: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n  offer_accepted?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingEntityPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype SharingEntityPayload = {\n  share: Array<{\n    partner_org_id: string\n    entities: Array<{\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n      offer_accepted?: { ... }\n    }>\n  }>\n  unshare: Array<{\n    partner_org_id: string\n    entities: Array<{\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n      offer_accepted?: { ... }\n    }>\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `PartnerEntitiesInput`\n\n```ts\ntype PartnerEntitiesInput = {\n  partner_org_id: string\n  entities: Array<{\n    schema: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    offer_accepted?: boolean\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `ShareChildEntityPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype ShareChildEntityPayload = {\n  share: Array<{\n    entity: {\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n      offer_accepted?: { ... }\n    }\n    partner_org_id: string\n  }>\n  unshare: Array<{\n    entity: {\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n      offer_accepted?: { ... }\n    }\n    partner_org_id: string\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `PartnerEntityInput`\n\n```ts\ntype PartnerEntityInput = {\n  entity: {\n    schema: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    offer_accepted?: boolean\n  }\n  partner_org_id: string\n}\n```\n\n### `OfferEntityPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype OfferEntityPayload = {\n  offer: Array<{\n    partner_org_id: string\n    offered_entities: Array<{\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n    }>\n  }>\n  unoffer: Array<{\n    partner_org_id: string\n    offered_entities: Array<{\n      schema: { ... }\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n    }>\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `PartnerOfferedEntitiesInput`\n\n```ts\ntype PartnerOfferedEntitiesInput = {\n  partner_org_id: string\n  offered_entities: Array<{\n    schema: string\n    entity_id: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `AcceptOfferPayload`\n\n```ts\ntype AcceptOfferPayload = {\n  partner_org_id: string\n  sharing_org_id: string\n  entity_id: string\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingRuleInput`\n\n```ts\ntype SharingRuleInput = {\n  name: string\n  enabled?: boolean\n  trigger_schema: string\n  include_schemas: string[]\n  evaluation_type: \"deterministic\" | \"ai\"\n  conditions?: {\n    logical_operator: \"AND\" | \"OR\"\n    statements: Array<{\n      id: { ... }\n      source: { ... }\n      operator: { ... }\n      values: { ... }\n    }>\n  }\n  ai_config?: {\n    confidence_threshold: number\n    guidance?: string\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingRuleUpdate`\n\nEvery SharingRuleInput field is optional. The patch is merged into the stored rule, then validated.\n\n```ts\ntype SharingRuleUpdate = {\n  name?: string\n  enabled?: boolean\n  trigger_schema?: string\n  include_schemas?: string[]\n  evaluation_type?: \"deterministic\" | \"ai\"\n  conditions?: {\n    logical_operator: \"AND\" | \"OR\"\n    statements: Array<{\n      id: { ... }\n      source: { ... }\n      operator: { ... }\n      values: { ... }\n    }>\n  }\n  ai_config?: {\n    confidence_threshold: number\n    guidance?: string\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingRule`\n\n```ts\ntype SharingRule = {\n  name: string\n  enabled: boolean\n  trigger_schema: string\n  include_schemas: string[]\n  evaluation_type: \"deterministic\" | \"ai\"\n  conditions?: {\n    logical_operator: \"AND\" | \"OR\"\n    statements: Array<{\n      id: { ... }\n      source: { ... }\n      operator: { ... }\n      values: { ... }\n    }>\n  }\n  ai_config?: {\n    confidence_threshold: number\n    guidance?: string\n  }\n  rule_id: string // uuid\n  vendor_org_id: string\n  partner_org_id: string\n  source: \"AUTO_SHARING_RULE\"\n  created_at: string // date-time\n  updated_at: string // date-time\n  created_by?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingRuleConditions`\n\nRequired iff evaluation_type is deterministic\n\n```ts\ntype SharingRuleConditions = {\n  logical_operator: \"AND\" | \"OR\"\n  statements: Array<{\n    id: string\n    source: {\n      attribute: { ... }\n      attribute_type: { ... }\n    }\n    operator: \"equals\" | \"not_equals\" | \"any_of\" | \"none_of\" | \"contains\" | \"not_contains\" | \"starts_with\" | \"ends_with\" | \"greater_than\" | \"less_than\" | \"is_empty\" | \"is_not_empty\"\n    values: string[]\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `Statement`\n\nSubset of the Flows condition Statement\n\n```ts\ntype Statement = {\n  id: string\n  source: {\n    attribute: string\n    attribute_type: \"string\" | \"text\" | \"number\" | \"boolean\" | \"date\" | \"datetime\" | \"tags\" | \"country\" | \"email\" | \"phone\" | \"status\" | \"relation\" | \"multiselect\" | \"select\" | \"radio\" | \"relation_user\" | \"purpose\" | \"label\" | \"price\"\n  }\n  operator: \"equals\" | \"not_equals\" | \"any_of\" | \"none_of\" | \"contains\" | \"not_contains\" | \"starts_with\" | \"ends_with\" | \"greater_than\" | \"less_than\" | \"is_empty\" | \"is_not_empty\"\n  values: string[]\n}\n```\n\n### `SharingRuleAiConfig`\n\nRequired iff evaluation_type is ai\n\n```ts\ntype SharingRuleAiConfig = {\n  confidence_threshold: number\n  guidance?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `EntitySharingEventsResponse`\n\n```ts\ntype EntitySharingEventsResponse = {\n  events: Array<{\n    id: string\n    timestamp: string // date-time\n    status: \"success\" | \"failure\"\n    action: \"shared\" | \"unshared\" | \"offered\" | \"unoffered\" | \"child_shared\" | \"child_unshared\"\n    user: {\n      user_id?: { ... }\n      email?: { ... }\n      display_name?: { ... }\n    }\n    partner_org_ids: string[]\n    entities: Array<{\n      entity_id: { ... }\n      schema: { ... }\n      parent_entity_id?: { ... }\n      title?: { ... }\n    }>\n  }>\n  total: number\n}\n```\n\n### `EntitySharingEvent`\n\n```ts\ntype EntitySharingEvent = {\n  id: string\n  timestamp: string // date-time\n  status: \"success\" | \"failure\"\n  action: \"shared\" | \"unshared\" | \"offered\" | \"unoffered\" | \"child_shared\" | \"child_unshared\"\n  user: {\n    user_id?: string\n    email?: string\n    display_name?: string\n  }\n  partner_org_ids: string[]\n  entities: Array<{\n    entity_id: string\n    schema: string\n    parent_entity_id?: string\n    title?: string\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n### `EntitySharingEventUser`\n\n```ts\ntype EntitySharingEventUser = {\n  user_id?: string\n  email?: string\n  display_name?: string\n}\n```\n\n### `EntitySharingEventEntity`\n\n```ts\ntype EntitySharingEventEntity = {\n  entity_id: string\n  schema: string\n  parent_entity_id?: string\n  title?: string\n}\n```\n"
